          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of a high-speed moving bright object followed by a trail and a second matte oval object; date error: misidentification with an artificial atmospheric reentry, involving the Cosmos 250 satellite.",
